        "data source date": "2025-12-15 00:00:00",
        "notes": "This mine operates under the Krasnobrodskoye subsoil land-use license \u041a\u0415\u041c11669\u0422\u042d, as identified through the Annual Report of JSC \u201cUK Kuzbassrazrezugol\u201d(\u0413\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u043e\u0442\u0447\u0435\u0442 \u0410\u041e \u00ab\u0423\u041a \u041a\u0443\u0437\u0431\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0440\u0435\u0437\u0443\u0433\u043e\u043b\u044c\u00bb), page 3, https://www.archive.org/details/Kuzbassrazrezugol2023, 2023. The license was issued on September 3, 2003, and is valid until December 31, 2032. The boundary was extracted from the NedraExpert portal at https://web.archive.org/web/20251219223515/https://www.nedraexpert.ru/license/144385?ysclid=mjdg4ia9a7745751665. The area between the Krasnobrodskoye and Vakhrushevskoye license boundaries is occupied by subsoil plots (including Karagailinskoye and Novosergeevskoye) classified as part of the Undistributed Subsoil Fund, indicating no active mining operations within this intervening area at the time of review. This was verified through the NedraExpert portal, https://web.archive.org/web/20251217220747/https://www.nedraexpert.ru/subsurface/2100027339/1, https://web.archive.org/web/20251219223601/https://www.nedraexpert.ru/subsurface/2100028211/1. The approximate area of the resulting boundary is 11 square km.",
